{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.haruki.fourth",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她带着父亲的答复来了",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.haruki.fourth",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.haruki.fourth",
    "idolId": "haruki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "傍晚的事务所。窗外的天色正在变。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "制作人先生……！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "爸爸，答应了",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "说\"既然要做，就别半途而废\"",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "太好了……被允许了……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你父亲……看上去是很严格的人啊。我还以为肯定不行。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "呵呵……连制作人先生都会这么想啊",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……不过他是个考虑得很深的人。不愧是はるき的父亲。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "说不定，父亲也这么想制作人先生呢",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "说\"这位制作人比想象中年轻，但看起来靠得住\"之类的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "はるき……！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……制作人先生，天空──",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！好漂亮。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "这叫做「魔术时刻」吧。什么都看起来很美的那段时间──",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "──制作人先生。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "我想找到的，是那种只能看一小会儿的天空。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "那值得我把全部押上去……我是这么想的。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那────",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我也押上全部吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……和はるき一起。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "…………是。"
      }
    }
  },
